sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Biz as Business
  participant PM as PM
  participant Dev as Development
  participant Ops as Operations
  participant Info as Info Mgmt
  participant QA as Quality
  participant Sponsor as Sponsor
  Note over Biz,Sponsor: CR-01 / ISSUE-03 / RISK-04 — fictional, as of 2026-10-14. Decisions pending 2026-10-16.<br/>Request evidence: purpose, recipients and acceptance criteria. Baseline: in-app/email only, SMS excluded.<br/>Provisional estimate: +8 person-days / +JPY 600,000.
  Biz->>PM: Request first-release SMS
  alt Request lacks evidence
    PM-->>Biz: Return for missing evidence
  else Assess the change without authorizing implementation
    Note over PM,QA: PM commissions parallel impact assessment.
    par Effort and delivery
      Dev-->>PM: Effort, date impact and alternatives
    and Personal data and external transmission
      Info-->>PM: Required evidence, safety blockers and owners
    and Operations
      Ops-->>PM: Operational constraints and handover checks
    and Independent validation
      QA-->>PM: Mandatory coverage and independent real-endpoint evidence
    end
    alt Information-management release conditions remain unmet
      Info-->>PM: Block release of the proposed change until specified evidence is accepted
      Note over PM,Sponsor: Sponsor cannot waive safety blockers. Keep the current baseline and CR-01 open.
    else Evidence permits Sponsor review
      PM->>Sponsor: Compare approval, deferral and rejection with cost, dates and residual risks
      alt Reject the request
        Sponsor-->>PM: Reject with reasons and reconsideration conditions
      else Defer SMS beyond the first release
        Sponsor-->>PM: Defer with an owner, next review date and required evidence or resources
      else Approve with explicit scope, funding and conditions
        Sponsor-->>PM: Conditionally approve only the recorded scope, cost and conditions
        Note over PM,Sponsor: Conditional approval alone does not activate a changed baseline
        alt Conditions or resources are still missing
          PM-->>Biz: Hold implementation, resolve conditions/resources
        else Conditions and resources are confirmed
          PM->>Dev: Version the baseline and authorize work
          Dev->>QA: Submit implementation and real-endpoint regression evidence
          Note over PM,QA: Failure or business return reopens linked work.<br/>Retest and acceptance must pass.
          alt Verification fails, evidence is incomplete or escalation is required
            QA-->>Dev: Return defects, keep release blocked
            Note over PM,Sponsor: CR-01 remains open, escalation is not acceptance or release authority
          else Independent verification passes and blockers are cleared
            QA-->>Biz: Present independent results against the agreed criteria
            alt Business returns
              Biz-->>PM: Return unaccepted criteria
            else Business accepts
              Biz-->>PM: Accept with evidence
              PM->>PM: Close CR-01 with evidence
            end
          end
        end
      end
      opt Rejection or deferral
        PM-->>Biz: Notify decision and next review
      end
    end
  end
